<div class="rn">
<h2>What&#x27;s New in 4.10</h2>
<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Expand console while reserving Now column.</li>
<li>Add persistent card visibility and responsive columns.</li>
<li>Recall sent prompts with Up and Down.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Allow task-owned checkouts for new chats.</li>
<li>Apply app appearance to native window chrome.</li>
<li>Preserve newer outcomes after late Stop failures.</li>
<li>Refresh physical checkout identity before selection.</li>
<li>Show readable activity times in results.</li>
<li>Retain queued draft ownership through settlement.</li>
</ul>
<p class="more">Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.10">https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.10</a></p>
</div>
